    <main>

        <section class="events---page--container">

            <h2>Events</h2>

            <aside class="events---page--intro">

                <p>Durham is a cultural heartland of the North East. The city is known for its historic landmarks, vibrant cultural scene, and lively nightlife. Durham is also home to a thriving arts and music scene.</p>

            </aside>

            <article class="discover---durham--events">

                <div>
                    <h3>Fire and Ice</h3>

                    <div class="events---image--clip">

                        <%= image_tag "photo-upcoming.png",
                            loading: "lazy",
                            class: "durham---events--image",
                            alt: "Fire and Ice",                            
                            title: "Fire and Ice" %>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <p>Fire and Ice is an annual winter celebration throughout the heart of Durham. On offer are Sculptures, live displays, and family-friendly entertainment to the heart of the city.<a href="https://www.lifeindurham.co.uk/event/fire-and-ice-2026/" target="_blank">Open</a></p>

            </article>

            <article class="discover---durham--events">

                <div>
                    <h3>Durham Pride</h3>
                    <div class="events---image--clip">

                        <%= image_tag "photo-upcoming.png",
                            loading: "lazy",
                            class: "durham---events--image",
                            alt: "Durham Pride",                            
                            title: "Durham Pride" %>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <p>Durham Pride is an LGBTQ+ charity that promotes and celebrates LGBTQ+ people. The annual Pride festival in Durham comes together to have a great time, celebrate the LBTQ+ community and raise awareness of the issues still faced by the community today.<a href="https://www.durhampride.org/" target="_blank">Open</a></p>

            </article>

            <article class="discover---durham--events">

                <div>
                    <h3>Durham Miners Gala</h3>
                    <div class="events---image--clip">

                        <%= image_tag "photo-upcoming.png",
                            loading: "lazy",
                            class: "durham---events--image",
                            alt: "Durham Miners Gala",                            
                            title: "Durham Miners Gala" %>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <p>The Durham Miners Gala is the world's largest gathering of trade unionists and a vibrant celebration of working-class culture and community solidarity, routinely drawing crowds of over 200,000 people to Durham City Centre.<a href="https://www.thisisdurham.com/whats-on/durham-miners-gala-2026-p1154261" target="_blank">Open</a></p>

            </article>

